; ted-openio-z-flag (#368): mycli goes on only if openio returns Z=0,
; but openio returns the condition codes of WBenchToFront.  TED alone
; under inject: WBenchToFront returns FALSE (as with the Workbench
; closed); menu CLI; inject types "endcli" + Return into the console
; window ("Blitz 2 CLI Window") 0.5 s after it opened; QUIT; inject
; reports whether the process's input/output handles are the ones it
; started with.  Correct: the shell runs in the console, ends with endcli,
; closeio restores the handles and closes the window; the original
; returns at once and leaves the console as TED's input/output.
; @source none
; @command TEDAB:tools/inject wbfrontfail handles keys=Blitz_2_CLI_Window/12@0,36@0,22@0,33@0,28@0,17@0,44@0 blitz2:ted
; @expect stdout "inject: wbfrontfail: 1 calls failed"
; @expect stdout "inject: handles: kept"
timeout 15
wait screen
menu 0 6
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
